---

<MainLayout>
  <BackButton />
  <h1>Target CD Collection</h1>
  <p class='disc-qty'>Currently {currentQty} discs.</p>

  <p class='jump-to-nav'>
    <a href='#jump-to-a'>A</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-b'>B</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-c'>C</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-d'>D</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-e'>E</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-f'>F</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-g'>G</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-h'>H</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-i'>I</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-j'>J</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-k'>K</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-l'>L</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-m'>M</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-n'>N</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-o'>O</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-p'>P</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-q'>Q</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-r'>R</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-s'>S</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-t'>T</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-u'>U</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-v'>V</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-w'>W</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-x'>X</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-y'>Y</a> /&nbsp;
    <a href='#jump-to-z'>Z</a>
  </p>

  <div class='text-wrapper'>
    <p>
      If you don't know what these are, the short explanation is they are early
      CDs that were pressed for the US market before we could make them here. If
      you would like better or more in-depth details, check out this <a
        href='https://www.discogs.com/forum/thread/398106'
        target='_blank'
        >Discogs forum page</a
      ><ExternalLinkIcon />.
    </p>

    <p>
      Click on any of the images to see a larger version. Any multiple entries
      are multiple copies in my collection. Sometimes they will be variants with
      minor differences, sometimes they will be duplicates.
    </p>
    <p>
      The cards are color coded by country of origin, Japan<span class='jpn'
      ></span>, West Germany<span class='wg'></span>, Other<span class='other'
      ></span>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section
    id='jump-to-a'
    class='jump-to-link'
  >
    <h2>A</h2>
    <div class='target-card-wrapper'>
      {aCds && aCds.map((cd) => <TargetCdCard cd={cd} />)}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    id='jump-to-b'
    class='jump-to-link'
